================================================================================

SaltRim is distributed as a standalone uberjar (see "Build & release" in
SPEC.md), which bundles its dependencies. Those dependencies keep their own
licenses; this file records what is included and under which terms. The
dependencies' own NOTICE and LICENSE files are merged into META-INF/ of the
built jar by tools.build, so they travel with the artifact as their licenses
require — this file is the human-readable index of the same thing.

Licenses are as declared in each project's POM. Where a project declares a
license family without a version, that is what is written here.

