================================================================================
Source handed over at runtime
================================================================================

SaltRim's function reference (the "f" panel) has a copy button that hands the
user the real implementation of a borrowed Excel function, which for the
borrowed half of the standard library is rechentafel's own source, read off the
classpath (see src/uno/michelada/saltrim/xlsource.clj). Every emitted snippet
carries a header naming rechentafel, its Apache-2.0 license and the exact
dependency coordinate, so the attribution travels with the code.
